HAMMOND: I said that's tea,
it may not be.

527
00:27:22,817 --> 00:27:25,883
咱们势头不错。
目前为止请来了艾伦·戴维斯，
We're doing well.
So far we've got Alan Davies,

528
00:27:25,917 --> 00:27:27,683
-这会儿他还在场上刷圈呢。
-没错。
-who's out there as we speak.
-Yeah.

529
00:27:30,083 --> 00:27:33,083
-刚才还来了个人，
不过谁也不知道他是哪位。
-穿得倒是挺讲究。
-And there was a man and
we don't know who he was.
-Very smart.

530
00:27:33,117 --> 00:27:36,517
上回特雷弗来上节目时，
可是捅了个天大的篓子——
The last time Trevor
had been on the show,
he'd had a bit of a disaster

531
00:27:36,550 --> 00:27:39,117
当时Liana的
车轮直接跑飞了。
when the wheel came
off the Liana.

532
00:27:41,817 --> 00:27:45,817
而这回，
就在他跑第四圈、
也是最后一圈练习圈时……
And this time,
while on his fourth
and final practice lap...

533
00:27:49,850 --> 00:27:51,550
这辆又被我给开报废了。
I broke this one as well.

534
00:27:51,583 --> 00:27:52,917
你对它干啥了？
What have you done to it?

535
00:27:52,950 --> 00:27:55,483
离合器烧了。
这车满打满算才开了26英里啊。
The clutch has gone.
It's only done 26 miles.

536
00:27:55,517 --> 00:27:59,017
而对这辆Lacetti来说，
它接下来的日子
也没好过到哪去。
And life for the Lacetti
wasn't about
to get any easier.

537
00:27:59,050 --> 00:28:01,350
♪ Carl Orff - O Fortuna ~ Carmina Burana ♪
♪ Carl Orff - O Fortuna ~ Carmina Burana ♪

538
00:28:01,350 --> 00:28:03,217
-路人：新演播室？
-克拉克森：新演播室。
-MAN: New studio?
-CLARKSON: New studio.

539
00:28:03,250 --> 00:28:06,483
-但更重要的是，换新车了。
-搞得真漂亮，太赞了。
-But more importantly new car.
-I love what you've done.

540
00:28:06,517 --> 00:28:10,683
“黑暗王子”闪亮登场——
吉米·卡尔。
The Prince of Darkness
had arrived, Jimmy Carr.

