-（众人大笑）
-Avoid full-throttle starts.
-(ALL LAUGHING)

550
00:28:33,083 --> 00:28:36,083
♪ Doves - Black and White Town ♪
♪ Doves - Black and White Town ♪

551
00:28:38,117 --> 00:28:39,383
那么我们来看看成绩。
So let's take stock.

552
00:28:39,417 --> 00:28:43,883
艾伦跑出了1分50秒3。
至于特雷弗·伊夫呢？
Alan had done a 1:50.3.
And as for Trevor Eve?

553
00:28:47,817 --> 00:28:49,817
-你觉得能跑多少？
-哎呀，来戏了。
-Where do you reckon?
-Oh, here we go.

554
00:28:49,817 --> 00:28:52,517
他刚才绝对狠狠挂错了一档，对吧？（笑声）
He really, really
missed one, eh? (LAUGHING)

555
00:28:52,550 --> 00:28:56,517
你当年的成绩是1分48秒。
You were a 1:48.

556
00:28:56,550 --> 00:28:59,083
-开那辆铃木Liana算相当过得去了。
-没错。
-Passable in the Suzuki Liana.
-Yeah.

557
00:28:59,117 --> 00:29:04,483
-你这次跑了1分……
你要击败的成绩是1分47秒6。
-对。
-You did it in one minute...
You 1:47.6 to beat.
-Yeah.

558
00:29:04,517 --> 00:29:06,883
1分40……
One minute, 40...

559
00:29:08,083 --> 00:29:09,817
-7……
-呃！
-Seven...
-Uh!

560
00:29:10,283 --> 00:29:12,083
-点……
-呃！
-Point...
-Uh!

561
00:29:12,117 --> 00:29:14,217
-零。
-噢！
-Zero.
-Oh!

562
00:29:14,250 --> 00:29:18,683
-特雷弗·伊夫，你现在
高居我们新榜榜首。
-很好。
-You are at the top of
our new board, Trevor Eve.
-Very good.

563
00:29:18,717 --> 00:29:19,917
不过能坐多久呢？
For how long, though?

564
00:29:19,950 --> 00:29:22,183
-应该没啥问题。
-（众人大笑）
-Shouldn't be a problem.
-(ALL LAUGHING)

565
00:29:22,200 --> 00:29:25,200
♪ 卡尔·奥尔夫 - 《布兰诗歌》~ 命运女神 ♪
♪ Carl Orff - O Fortuna ~ Carmina Burana ♪

566
00:29:25,583 --> 00:29:29,083
在吉米热身的时候，
下一位嘉宾到了。
While Jimmy was limbering up,
our next guest arrived.

567
00:29:29,117 --> 00:29:31,850
克拉克森：“黑暗乐队”的贾斯汀。
CLARKSON: Justin
out of The Darkness.

568
00:29:31,883 --> 00:29:33,817
-哈蒙德：这不就来了嘛。
-冻死我了。
-HAMMOND: There you go.
-I'm freezing.

569
00:29:33,817 --> 00:29:36,050
太阳出来的时候，
天儿还挺不错的。
When the sun's out
it's a beautiful day.

570
00:29:36,083 --> 00:29:38,050
我觉得咱们这游园会
办得挺有模有样。
I feel our garden party's
working well.

571
00:29:39,683 --> 00:29:41,250
克拉克森：与此同时。
CLARKSON: Meanwhile.

572
00:29:42,117 --> 00:29:43,317
（大笑）
(LAUGHING)

573
00:29:44,250 --> 00:29:46,283
而且他还没折腾够呢。
And he wasn't finished yet.

574
00:29:46,317 --> 00:29:47,817
-（轮胎尖叫）
-呃。
-(TYRES SCREECH)
-Uff.

575
00:29:49,683 --> 00:29:54,050
吉米，你现在干的事，
就是在慢刀子毁这辆车。
What you're doing, Jimmy,
is slowly destroying this car.

576
00:29:54,083 --> 00:29:55,517
-是吗？
-是的。
-Yeah?
-Yeah.

577
00:29:55,550 --> 00:29:57,783
天知道今天下午还会有多少
明星嘉宾要过来，
And we don't know how many
other celebrities might arrive

578
00:29:57,817 --> 00:30:01,150
也想跑上几圈，到时候我们只能说：
“车报废了。”
this afternoon that wanna go
and we'll have to say,
"Car wrecked."

579
