我想哭一会儿。
我叫理查德。
I'm having a little cry.
My name's Richard.

580
00:30:03,250 --> 00:30:05,417
三、二、一。
Three, two, one.

581
00:30:05,450 --> 00:30:06,783
跑！
Go!

582
00:30:06,800 --> 00:30:09,800
♪ 卡尔·奥尔夫 - 《布兰诗歌》~ 命运女神 ♪
♪ Carl Orff - O Fortuna ~ Carmina Burana ♪

583
00:30:16,617 --> 00:30:19,350
得，又来了。
发动机严重回火了。
Well, that happened again.
It's over-firing.

584
00:30:21,717 --> 00:30:24,050
我往后躲躲。
I'm moving back.

585
00:30:24,083 --> 00:30:27,917
作为前任圈速榜霸主，
吉米可丢不起这个人。
As a former lap board leader,
Jimmy couldn't afford
to lose it.

586
00:30:27,950 --> 00:30:29,750
克拉克森：关键时刻到了，
倒数第二个弯角。
CLARKSON: This is it,
second to last corner.

587
00:30:29,783 --> 00:30:31,483
失控了。
不，又救回来了！
He's lost it.
No, he's got it back!

588
00:30:31,517 --> 00:30:34,217
哈蒙德：失控了。
稳住了。
幅度太大了！太夸张了！
HAMMOND: He's lost it.
He's held it.
It's huge! It's huge!

589
00:30:34,250 --> 00:30:35,750
克拉克森：噢，彻底转出去了！
CLARKSON: Oh, she's gone!

590
00:30:35,783 --> 00:30:37,683
他在正式计时圈里打滑出去了。
He's gone on his timed lap.

591
00:30:37,717 --> 00:30:39,883
-这下损失大了。
-哈蒙德：代价极其惨痛。
-That's cost him.
-HAMMOND: Cost him dear.

592
00:30:40,883 --> 00:30:42,017
这真是……
That is...

593
00:30:43,683 --> 00:30:45,750
（轮胎剧烈尖叫）
(TYRES SCREECHING)

594
00:30:45,783 --> 00:30:47,383
杰里米，我觉得我有戏。
I think I'm in
with a shot, Jeremy.

595
00:30:47,417 --> 00:30:48,817
你跑出了
You did it

596
00:30:50,217 --> 00:30:52,283
有史以来的最慢成绩，
in the slowest ever time,

597
00:30:52,317 --> 00:30:54,717
2分08秒9。
two minutes, 8.9 seconds.

598
00:30:54,817 --> 00:30:56,350
干得漂亮，吉米·卡尔，
真是太精彩了。
Well done, Jimmy Carr,
that's brilliant.

599
00:30:56,383 --> 00:30:58,417
-吉米·卡尔，
你在最底下趴着呢。
-真是彻底没救。
-Jimmy Carr,
you're down there.
-Truly hopeless.

600
00:30:58,450 --> 00:31:00,250
这车不行，
刚才纯粹是车的问题。
It's not a good car,
that's what happened there.

601
00:31:00,283 --> 00:31:01,700
♪ Shawn Lee - Happiness ♪
♪ Shawn Lee - Happiness ♪

602
00:31:01,717 --> 00:31:04,550
克拉克森：正当一位摇滚巨星
在加紧练车时……
CLARKSON: While one rock god
was practising...

603
00:31:04,583 --> 00:31:05,950
（轻笑）我的天！
(CHUCKLES) Jeez!

604
00:31:05,983 --> 00:31:09,483
……另一位大神也到了，
正是里克·威克曼本尊。
...another one arrived,
Rick Wakeman, no less.

605
00:31:09,517 --> 00:31:11,383
早知道里克要来，
If we'd have known
Rick was coming,

606
00:31:11,417 --> 00:31:13,550
我就该在整条赛道上铺满干冰。
I'd have got dry ice
for the whole track.

607
00:31:14,950 --> 00:31:17,983
贾斯汀在飞驰圈里拼尽了全力。
Justin was giving it all
on his flying lap.

608
00:31:18,017 --> 00:31:22,350
但我恐怕我们都被眼前这场
专属草地音乐会给分心了。
But I'm afraid we'd become
distracted by our very own
concert in the park.

609
00:31:22,383 --> 00:31:23,850
（键盘演奏中）
(PLAYING)

610
00:31:28,817 --> 00:31:30,650
祈祷吧，该死的，快祈祷！
Pray, damn you, pray!

611
00:31:36,217 --> 00:31:39,483
杰里米：（大笑）
我梦回70年代了！
JEREMY: (LAUGHS)
I'm in the '70s!

612
00:31:39,517 --> 00:31:41,817
我回到70年代了！
I'm in the '70s!

613
00:31:48,083 --> 00:31:49,183
漂亮！
Yeah!

614
00:31:50,583 --> 00:31:52,350
接下来，加演一曲。
And, for an encore.

615
00:31:52,383 --> 00:31:55,450
-你认识莱斯·费迪南德吗？
-我知道他。
-Do you know Les Ferdinand?
-I know of Les Ferdinand.

616
00:31:55,483 --> 00:31:57,717
莱斯·费迪南德，这位是贾斯汀·霍金斯。
Les Ferdinand, Justin Hawkins.

617
00:31:57,817 --> 00:31:59,350
幸会幸会。
Nice to meet you.

618
00:31:59,383 --> 00:32:01,650
1分48秒4。
1:48.4.

619
00:32:01,683 --> 00:32:03,250
-瞧瞧这成绩。
-真不赖。
-There you go.
-That's not bad.

620
00:32:03,283 --> 00:32:04,483
确实到位了。
That is there.

621
00:32:04,517 --> 00:32:07,817
下一位，摇滚元老登场。
Up next, rock god senior.

622
00:32:07,850 --> 00:32:11,250
里克·威克曼刚跟大家透露，
他这辈子发作过好几次心脏病。
Rick Wakeman's just
announced he's had several
heart attacks in his life.

623
00:32:11,283 --> 00:32:14,283
-（引擎轰鸣）
-慢点儿，里克，悠着点。
-(ENGINE REVS)
-Watch it, Rick, watch it.

624
00:32:14,317 --> 00:32:18,183
-（轮胎尖叫）
-噢！他随时都可能两腿一蹬啊。
-(TYRES SCREECHING)
-Oh! He could let go
at any time.

625
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:19,917
♪ Yes - Cans and Brahms ♪
♪ Yes - Cans and Brahms ♪

626
00:32:19,950 --> 00:32:23,117
里克的键盘独奏
向来以冗长出名。
Now Rick's keyboard solos
are known for being
quite long.

627
00:32:23,150 --> 00:32:25,883
但跟他的单圈耗时比起来，
那简直是小巫见大巫。
But they were nothing
compared to his lap.

628
00:32:27,517 --> 00:32:30,450
问题是，
他会像弹琴一样在仪表盘上乱拍一气。
The problem is,
he'll be all over the
dashboard like this.

629
00:32:30,483 --> 00:32:31,717
还真是。
Yeah.

630
00:32:35,617 --> 00:32:37,817
四轮着地，顺利通过甘邦弯。
And through Gambon
on all four wheels.

631
00:32:37,817 --> 00:32:41,050
里克最终跑出了1分55秒3，
Rick eventually did it
in 1:55.3,

632
00:32:41,083 --> 00:32:45,517
接着他猛然想起，
莱斯·费迪南德在1992年的那记进球，
and then suddenly remembered
that a Les Ferdinand goal
in 1992

633
00:32:45,550 --> 00:32:49,083
曾导致他心爱的曼城队惨遭降级。
had relegated his beloved
football team, Man City.

634
00:32:49,117 --> 00:32:50,983
里克，你得放下执念啊，里克。
Rick, you've got to
let it go, Rick.

635
00:32:51,017 --> 00:32:54,817
你狂奔全场，把所有人都过得干干净净，
You ran the whole length
of the pitch, you bloody
well beat everybody

636
00:32:54,817 --> 00:32:59,083
然后轰进一记世界波，
我这辈子都没这么火大过！
and scored a fantastic goal
and I've never been so
pissed off in my entire life.

637
00:32:59,117 --> 00:33:02,283
接着里克想来块那位女士带的饼干。
Then Rick wanted
one of our lady biscuits.

638
00:33:02,317 --> 00:33:05,317
那位女士的蛋糕少了三块。
请问一下，呃……
Three of the lady's cakes
have gone.
Can I ask, um...

639
00:33:07,217 --> 00:33:08,317
是他偷吃的。
It was him.

640
00:33:08,350 --> 00:33:11,350
♪ The Zutons -
Why Won't You Give Me Your Love?
(Instrumental) ♪
♪ The Zutons -
Why Won't You Give Me Your Love?
(Instrumental) ♪

641
00:33:14,983 --> 00:33:16,983
（两人合奏）
(BOTH PLAYING)

642
00:33:21,650 --> 00:33:24,083
场面开始失控了。
Things were getting
out of hand.

643
00:33:24,117 --> 00:33:26,983
噢，你个大笨蛋！
咱们得管人家要回来了。
Oh, you pillock!
We'll have to ask
for that back.

644
00:33:31,817 --> 00:33:34,150
你说那位老兄
纳闷到底发生什么了吗？
Do you think that man's
wondering what's going on?

645
00:33:35,050 --> 00:33:36,150
谢了。
Thanks.

646
00:33:38,317 --> 00:33:41,483
到目前为止，特雷弗·伊夫
刷出了全天的最快圈速。
So far, Trevor Eve had set
the fastest time of the day.

647
00:33:41,517 --> 00:33:45,450
莱斯是现在唯一能击败他的人，
而且天哪，
Les was now the only man
who could beat him, and boy,

648
00:33:45,483 --> 00:33:46,617
（轮胎尖叫声）
(TYRES SCREECHING)

649
00:33:46,650 --> 00:33:47,917
他简直像杀疯了一样。
was he on a mission.

650
00:33:47,950 --> 00:33:50,950
♪ 马克·艾尔斯 - 《终结者》主题曲 ♪
♪ Mark Ayres - Terminator Theme ♪

651
00:33:59,583 --> 00:34:01,050
大家伙儿，能准备一下吗？
Everybody, can you be ready?

652
00:34:02,850 --> 00:34:04,683
他要是在倒数第二个弯失控，
If he loses it on
the second to last corner,

653
00:34:04,717 --> 00:34:06,583
可就直接一头撞穿茶托盘了。
he's gonna drive
straight through the tea tray.

654
00:34:06,617 --> 00:34:08,850
等等，这圈好快。
不对，这也太快了！
Wait. This is quick.
No, it's too quick!

655
00:34:11,950 --> 00:34:14,717
-这完全是跑拉力的开法。
-可不是嘛。
-That was rally driving.
-Yes, it was.

656
00:34:18,050 --> 00:34:20,317
-我想排在最顶上。
-（拍打成绩板声）
-I wanted to be up there.
-(BANGING BOARD)

657
00:34:20,350 --> 00:34:22,350
我不敢确定做没做到。
I'm not sure I've done it.

658
00:34:22,383 --> 00:34:24,083
你要超的目标是1分47秒。
You've got 1:47 to beat.

659
00:34:24,117 --> 00:34:25,150
1分，
One,

660
00:34:25,517 --> 00:34:26,917
40……
40...

661
00:34:28,583 --> 00:34:30,950
-7秒……
-噢，开什么玩笑！
-Seven...
-Oh, you're joking!

662
00:34:30,983 --> 00:34:33,950
-点四。
-所以我刚才要是没冲出去，
早就把它秒杀了！
-Point four.
-So if I hadn't gone off there
I'd have smashed that.

663
00:34:33,983 --> 00:34:35,983
-你本来确实能秒了它。
-我本来绝对能爆杀这成绩……
-You'd have smashed it.
-I would have smashed that...

664
00:34:36,017 --> 00:34:39,050
-这已经是个好成绩了。
-确实挺不错的。
-That was a good time.
-It was a good time.

665
00:34:39,083 --> 00:34:41,017
哈蒙德：但他永远都不会满意的。
HAMMOND: But he's never
going to be happy with it.

666
00:34:41,050 --> 00:34:44,417
我一点都不高兴。
别给我鼓掌。
别为这成绩拍手。
I'm not happy.
Don't clap for me.
Don't clap for that.

667
00:34:44,450 --> 00:34:46,150
他要去弹一首应景的曲子了。
He's going to play
something suitable.

668
00:34:46,183 --> 00:34:48,250
（弹起瘆人的调子）
(PLAYS SCARY TUNE)

669
00:34:48,283 --> 00:34:49,583
这能让你心里好受点吗？
Does that make you
feel better?

670
00:34:49,617 --> 00:34:51,583
我就打算生着闷气走去那头。
I'm just gonna sulk off
and walk down there.

671
00:34:51,617 --> 00:34:54,717
这就是离场专属背景乐，对吧？
That's the walking away music,
isn't it?

672
00:34:54,817 --> 00:34:57,683
他永远、永远都不会……瞧瞧。
He's never, ever going to...
Look.

673
00:34:58,817 --> 00:35:00,817
这画风开始变诡异了。
This is now weird.

674
00:35:05,250 --> 00:35:07,650
经历这么折腾的一天后，实在挺难说的，
Bit difficult to tell, really,
after a day like that,

675
00:35:07,683 --> 00:35:12,350
但我们觉得这台新 Lacetti 每圈
大概能快上一秒左右，
but we think that
the new Lacetti may be around
a second a lap quicker

676
00:35:12,383 --> 00:35:14,850
相比老款 Liana 而言。
than the old Liana.

677
00:35:14,883 --> 00:35:16,617
不过下周我们就能彻底弄清楚了，
But we'll find out
for certain next week

678
00:35:16,650 --> 00:35:21,383
届时“廉价车廉价名人”环节
将回归正常。
when the star in
a reasonably priced
car feature returns to normal.

679
00:35:21,417 --> 00:35:25,817
行了，闲话少说。
柴油车新闻时间到！
Anyway, enough of that.
It's time for diesel news!

680
00:35:27,050 --> 00:35:29,250
瞧，这是一台 JCB。
Now, this is a JCB.

681
00:35:29,283 --> 00:35:32,017
它搭载的是一台
四缸柴油发动机，
It's powered by
a four-cylinder diesel engine

682
00:35:32,050 --> 00:35:35,083
大概能爆发出
125匹制动马力。
which develops round about
125 brake horsepower.

683
00:35:35,117 --> 00:35:39,383
当然了，这也赋予了它
高达每小时6英里的极速。
And then of course gives it
a top speed of 6mph.

684
00:35:39,417 --> 00:35:42,517
不过，他们现在
拿了两台这种发动机，
However, they've now
taken two of those engines,

685
00:35:42,550 --> 00:35:46,383
硬生生压榨到了
每台750匹马力，
they've spanked them up
to 750 horsepower each

686
00:35:46,417 --> 00:35:49,250
然后把两台统统塞进了
那玩意儿里。
and they've put them both
in that.

687
00:35:49,283 --> 00:35:51,950
没错，这就是柴油极速号（Diesel Max）。
Yes, this is the Diesel Max.

688
00:35:51,983 --> 00:35:55,650
这是JCB为了打破
柴油汽车陆地极速世界纪录
And it's JCB's
attempt at breaking the
world land speed record

689
00:35:55,683 --> 00:35:57,717
而发起的一场挑战。
for diesel powered cars.

690
00:35:57,817 --> 00:36:03,017
不过开这台JCB的，可不会是个
穿着老汉背心、露着屁股沟的粗汉。
Now this JCB isn't gonna be
driven by a bloke in a vest
with his bum crack showing.

691
00:36:03,050 --> 00:36:07,350
实际上，坐进驾驶舱的
将是现任绝对陆地极速世界纪录保持者——
It will in fact be driven
by the current absolute world
land speed record holder,

692
00:36:07,383 --> 00:36:09,250
安迪·格林空军中校。
Wing Commander Andy Green.

693
00:36:09,283 --> 00:36:13,817
不过看那座舱大小，想钻进去，
他顶多只能有六岁。
Who, from the size of
the thing, in order to get in,
he must be about six.

694
00:36:13,817 --> 00:36:15,550
确实。假定他真能塞进去，
Indeed. And assuming
he does get in,

695
00:36:15,583 --> 00:36:19,217
他们会把它运到
美国的邦纳维尔盐滩，
they're going to take it
to the Bonneville Salt Flats
in America,

696
00:36:19,250 --> 00:36:24,517
在那里，他们将尝试突破
每小时300英里的大关。
where they are going
to be attempting to crack
300 miles an hour.

697
00:36:24,550 --> 00:36:28,083
要是真成功了，他们大概会把盐滩全刨了，
好让别人谁也别想破纪录。
And if they do do that,
they'll dig it all up so that
no-one else can have a go.

698
00:36:28,117 --> 00:36:31,050
行了。我有个大事
要宣布。
Enough. I've an
announcement to make.

699
00:36:31,083 --> 00:36:35,250
在4月14日，
下午整整3点整，
On April 14,
at precisely 3:00
in the afternoon,

700
00:36:35,283 --> 00:36:38,350
我向自己一生中
最大的挚爱告别了。
I bade farewell to
the greatest love
of my life.

701
00:36:38,383 --> 00:36:39,817
我戒烟了。
I gave up smoking.

702
00:36:39,850 --> 00:36:41,717
我们可太深有体会了！
And don't we know it!

703
00:36:42,383 --> 00:36:44,817
我很冷静，我冷静得很。
I'm calm, I'm calm.

704
00:36:44,850 --> 00:36:48,550
你看，事情是这样的，行吧，市面上
确实有一堆产品
And you see the thing is,
okay, there are a number
of products on the market

705
00:36:48,583 --> 00:36:50,583
号称能帮你熬过烟瘾，对吧？
to help get over
the craving, okay?

706
00:36:50,617 --> 00:36:53,083
比如有那么个大师，你每次想来一根，
There's this chap
who helps himself

707
00:36:53,117 --> 00:36:55,383
他就把你钱包里的钱搜刮个精光。
to everything in your wallet
every time you want a fag.

708
00:36:55,417 --> 00:36:59,183
还有各种戒烟DVD、书、戒烟糖、戒烟贴。
There's DVDs, there's books,
there's gum, there's patches.

709
00:36:59,217 --> 00:37:04,083
但关键是，
我现在找到了克制烟瘾的
绝世良方。
But the thing is
I have now found the
greatest cure for the craving.

710
00:37:04,117 --> 00:37:08,983
它来自瑞典，
名字叫作——
柯尼塞格CCX（Koenigsegg CCX）。
It comes from Sweden
and it's called
a Koenigsegg CCX.

711
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:12,000
♪ Amon Tobin - Hokkaido ♪
♪ Amon Tobin - Hokkaido ♪

712
00:37:15,150 --> 00:37:18,283
当年的第一台柯尼塞格就是个狠角色。
The first Koenigsegg
was quite a car.

713
00:37:18,317 --> 00:37:22,617
它至今还保持着人类历史上
最离谱超速罚单的纪录。
It still holds the record for
the biggest speeding ticket
ever issued.

714
00:37:24,017 --> 00:37:28,150
在得克萨斯州，
狂飙到了时速242英里。
242 miles an hour
in Texas.

715
00:37:32,817 --> 00:37:34,917
几年前我们公路测试过那台车，
Road tested that car
a couple of years ago

716
00:37:34,950 --> 00:37:38,317
简直成了我们摄像组的梦魇，
and it was a nightmare
for our camera crews

717
00:37:38,350 --> 00:37:40,950
因为镜头摇摄时
他们根本追不上车。
'cause they couldn't
keep up with it
in the panning shots.

718
00:37:43,183 --> 00:37:46,817
我觉得他们对今天这台也不会多待见，
因为……呃，
And I don't think
they're gonna like this one
much either 'cause, um,

719
00:37:47,650 --> 00:37:49,317
它还要更快。
it's even faster.

720
00:37:49,350 --> 00:37:51,517
♪ Juno Reactor & Don Davis -
The Trainman Cometh ♪
♪ Juno Reactor & Don Davis -
The Trainman Cometh ♪

721
00:37:51,550 --> 00:37:56,883
老款在我们跑道上的
极速跑到了174英里/小时。
The old car topped out on
our runway at 174mph.

722
00:37:56,917 --> 00:38:00,317
来看看这台
能跑出什么成绩。
So let's see what
this one can do.

723
00:38:01,817 --> 00:38:05,217
0到60英里，3.2秒。
0-60, 3.2 seconds.

724
00:38:05,250 --> 00:38:07,217
我已经飙到158了！
I'm already at 158.

725
00:38:08,117 --> 00:38:10,650
175、178、183，
175, 178, 183,

726
00:38:10,683 --> 00:38:12,817
188、190！
188, 190.

727
00:38:12,817 --> 00:38:14,817
车身开始变得极度暴躁了。
It's getting awfully edgy.

728
00:38:15,917 --> 00:38:17,917
我的天，开始乱扭了！
Oh, my God, it's swerving!

729
00:38:17,950 --> 00:38:21,017
这真的……要坏事了。
It's really... This is bad.

730
00:38:26,383 --> 00:38:28,017
（大笑）
(LAUGHING)

731
00:38:31,883 --> 00:38:35,850
真是台神车！
比之前来过这儿的任何玩意儿
都要快。
What a machine!
That's quicker than anything
that's been here before.

732
00:38:36,683 --> 00:38:39,317
而且是快了一大截。
♪ Autechre - Foil ♪
By a long way.
♪ Autechre - Foil ♪

733
00:38:39,350 --> 00:38:44,083
要是大直道够长，
这家伙能飙到
每小时250英里。
Given enough space,
this will get to
250 miles an hour.

734
00:38:44,117 --> 00:38:47,550
这速度已经极其逼近
布加迪威龙了。
And that puts it awfully close
to the Bugatti Veyron.

735
00:38:48,650 --> 00:38:50,950
能有这本事，
主要归功于三点。
There are three main reasons
for this.

736
00:38:53,183 --> 00:38:57,417
它极轻，全车
都是用碳纤维打造的。
It's very light. The whole car
is made from carbon fibre.

737
00:39:00,717 --> 00:39:06,117
它还非常滑溜，
风阻系数
跟条鱼差不多。
It's also very slippery.
It has the drag coefficient
of a fish.

738
00:39:09,150 --> 00:39:13,550
但最狂暴的底气，
还是来自引擎盖底下。
But mostly, the oomph comes
from under the bonnet.

739
00:39:13,583 --> 00:39:19,250
老款搭载的是福特引擎，
能爆发出
655匹制动马力。
The old car had
a Ford engine which developed
655 brake horsepower.

740
00:39:19,283 --> 00:39:23,217
而这台的引擎，
是柯尼塞格纯自研的。
This one has an engine
made by Koenigsegg themselves.

741
00:39:23,250 --> 00:39:27,117
这是一台双机械增压的
4.7升V8发动机，
It's a twin-supercharged
4.7-litre V8

742
00:39:27,150 --> 00:39:31,583
能够压榨出
整整806匹制动马力。
and it develops
806 brake horsepower.

743
00:39:33,183 --> 00:39:36,183
806匹制动马力啊！
806 brake horsepower.

744
00:39:36,217 --> 00:39:38,317
大概有这么厚厚一叠。
That's about that much.

745
00:39:38,350 --> 00:39:42,450
而且这还是喝了美国人所谓
“软趴趴洗洁精”汽油
跑出来的成绩。
And that's on that
limp-wristed fairy liquid,
the Americans call petrol.

746
00:39:42,483 --> 00:39:46,283
要是喂它我们在欧洲喝的
这种更劲爆的“土法烈酒”，
If you run this on the more
explosive jungle juice
we have here in Europe

747
00:39:46,317 --> 00:39:49,317
你就能得到850匹马力。
you'll be getting 850bhp.

748
00:39:49,350 --> 00:39:51,083
噢，再给你们支个招。
Oh, and I'll give you
a little tip.

749
00:39:51,117 --> 00:39:55,450
要是把这台引擎调校成
烧环保生物燃料的话，
If you tune this engine to
run on environmentally
friendly bio-fuel,

750
00:39:55,483 --> 00:39:58,850
你就能压榨出
900匹制动马力。
you'll be getting
900 brake horsepower.

751
00:40:00,883 --> 00:40:02,650
真该给比尔·奥迪也整一台。
Should get Bill Oddie
one of these.

752
00:40:02,683 --> 00:40:04,517
♪ Rob Zombie - Reload ♪
♪ Rob Zombie - Reload ♪

753
00:40:04,550 --> 00:40:06,683
几个星期以来头一回，
For the first time in weeks,

754
00:40:06,717 --> 00:40:11,217
我现在能摸着良心
拍着胸脯说：
“我一点都不想抽烟了。”
I can put my hand on
my heart right now and say,
"I don't want a cigarette."

755
00:40:11,250 --> 00:40:13,717
我只想再来点这个！
I just want more of this!

756
00:40:19,050 --> 00:40:21,217
谁还需要尼古丁啊！
Who needs nicotine?

757
00:40:25,983 --> 00:40:27,150
（呻吟）
(GROANS)

758
00:40:31,383 --> 00:40:35,583
这声浪简直绝了！
The sound is just astonishing!

759
00:40:35,617 --> 00:40:42,617
我觉得“柯尼塞格”在瑞典语里
意思肯定是：“卧槽！
我的脑浆刚被轰炸裂了！”
I think Koenigsegg
is Swedish for, "Oh, no!
My head's just exploded!"

760
00:40:43,917 --> 00:40:47,750
而且坐在这车里，
叫破喉咙也没人听得见。
And in here,
no one can hear you scream.

761
00:40:49,983 --> 00:40:52,150
这真让人忍不住想问，
It really does
beg a question,

762
00:40:52,183 --> 00:40:53,617
他们装个收音机到底是图啥？
why have they fitted a radio?

763
00:40:53,650 --> 00:40:57,050
在里面你连大嗓门克里斯·莫伊尔斯都听不清。
You couldn't even hear
Chris Moyles on that.

764
00:40:57,083 --> 00:40:59,050
它之所以装收音机，
The reason why
it has a radio is

765
00:40:59,083 --> 00:41:02,683
跟新车比老款稍微做高了一点是同一个原因——
the same reason why this
new car is slightly taller
than the old one,

766
00:41:02,717 --> 00:41:07,183
因为它理应变得更好开、
更适合日常代步。
because it's supposed
to be easier to drive
and easier to live with.

767
00:41:07,200 --> 00:41:08,800
♪ Amon Tobin - Natureland ♪
♪ Amon Tobin - Natureland ♪

768
00:41:08,817 --> 00:41:12,817
你依然能拥有那种垂直向上的癫狂车门。
You still get the mad doors
that open vertically.

769
00:41:12,817 --> 00:41:17,617
不过你可千万别停在太高的路肩旁，
原因显而易见。
Although you want to make sure
you don't park alongside a
tall kerb for obvious reasons.

770
00:41:17,650 --> 00:41:22,950
而且车顶依然可以整个拆下来，
直接变身敞篷跑车。
And you still get this roof
which lifts out so that the
car becomes a convertible.

771
00:41:26,083 --> 00:41:30,250
坐进车内，依然是《布莱克的七人》那种科幻中控，
Inside, you still get
the Blake's 7 controls,

772
00:41:30,283 --> 00:41:34,850
但因为车身变高了，
哪怕是丹尼斯·罗德曼都能塞进方向盘后面，
but because it's now taller,
even Dennis Rodman
could fit behind the wheel

773
00:41:34,883 --> 00:41:36,217
♪ Amon Tobin - Ruthless ♪
♪ Amon Tobin - Ruthless ♪

774
00:41:36,217 --> 00:41:38,283
亲身体验这种极致的恐惧。
and experience the terror.

775
00:41:39,683 --> 00:41:41,817
我指的绝对是货真价实的恐惧。
And I do mean terror.

776
00:41:41,817 --> 00:41:43,283
（引擎启动声）
(ENGINE STARTING)

777
00:41:44,983 --> 00:41:48,950
我是说，这台机器能爆发出800多匹制动马力，
I mean, this develops more
than 800 brake horsepower,

778
00:41:48,983 --> 00:41:53,917
却没有后尾翼
把那对宽大的后轮死死压在路面上。
but there's no rear spoiler
to push those massive rear
tyres into the road.

779
00:41:53,950 --> 00:41:56,083
牵引力控制系统也是甭想了。
There's no
traction control either.

780
00:41:56,117 --> 00:41:58,883
至于后车窗嘛，简直……呃……
And the rear window
is just, um...

781
00:41:58,917 --> 00:42:02,517
就像个潜艇舷窗，
后面有什么你压根两眼一抹黑。
It's just a porthole,
so you can't see
what's behind.

782
00:42:02,550 --> 00:42:05,217
不过，是时候带它去弯道遛遛了，
Still, the time has come
to show it some corners

783
00:42:06,217 --> 00:42:08,083
看看它到底有几斤几两。
and see what's what.

784
00:42:08,100 --> 00:42:11,100
♪ Alan Silvestri - Useless Crucifix ♪
♪ Alan Silvestri - Useless Crucifix ♪

785
00:42:13,950 --> 00:42:15,983
（惊呼）
(EXCLAIMING)

786
00:42:16,017 --> 00:42:20,317
不像其他任何超级跑车，
无论是福特GT、帕加尼风之子，
Unlike any other supercar,
a Ford TT or a Zonda or

787
00:42:21,183 --> 00:42:23,583
还是法拉利恩佐，
even an Enzo,

788
00:42:23,617 --> 00:42:27,983
这台车丝毫没有被规训或驯服的痕迹。
this doesn't feel
sanitised or tame.

789
00:42:28,950 --> 00:42:33,083
它就是纯粹的狂野与癫狂。
It's just completely
wild and mad.

790
00:42:33,117 --> 00:42:37,883
这是最原始、最凶残、毫无节制的力量。
It's raw, vicious,
unbridled power.

791
00:42:37,917 --> 00:42:42,317
只要你稍有越界，
哪怕只是一丁点，它就能要你的命。
And if you overstep the mark,
even slightly, it'll kill you.

792
00:42:46,050 --> 00:42:51,450
老款车开起来非常、非常快，
而且极其难开。
The old car was
very, very fast and
very difficult to drive.

793
00:42:51,483 --> 00:42:57,717
这台更是快上加快，而且照样极难驾驭。哇喔！
This is even faster and still
very difficult to drive. Whoa!

794
00:42:57,817 --> 00:43:04,683
柯尼塞格声称这车更舒适了，
但它是跟什么比更舒适？
Koenigsegg say this is more
comfortable, but more
comfortable than what?

795
00:43:05,683 --> 00:43:07,250
被人捅一刀吗？
Being stabbed?

796
00:43:09,383 --> 00:43:10,950
天哪，但真是太刺激了！
God, it's fun, though!

797
00:43:10,983 --> 00:43:12,483
♪ Amon Tobin - Natureland ♪
♪ Amon Tobin - Natureland ♪

798
00:43:12,483 --> 00:43:14,383
最近几周，戒烟带来的烟瘾发作
In recent weeks,
a craving for nicotine

799
00:43:14,417 --> 00:43:17,217
让我看什么都不顺眼，连树都不放过。
has made me angry
with everything, even trees.

800
00:43:17,250 --> 00:43:19,083
那颜色长得根本就不对劲！
It's just completely
the wrong colour.

801
00:43:19,117 --> 00:43:22,883
