-快逃就是了。
-Are you through?
-Just get out.

1065
00:57:12,017 --> 00:57:13,283
出去。赶紧逃出去。
Get out. Just get out.

1066
00:57:16,317 --> 00:57:18,350
-继续跑。
-快跑！
-Keep running.
-Run!

1067
00:57:20,317 --> 00:57:21,383
往那边跑！
Over there!

1068
00:57:21,417 --> 00:57:22,617
（众人大笑）
(ALL LAUGHING)

1069
00:57:26,383 --> 00:57:27,617
-惨不忍睹。
-简直惨绝人寰。
-That's bad.
-That was bad.

1070
00:57:31,517 --> 00:57:33,717
-呃，它起火了。
-两人：起什么？！
-Uh, it's on fire.
-BOTH: It's what?

1071
00:57:33,817 --> 00:57:35,917
-彻底被干废了……
-不可能起火啊！
-Absolutely murdered...
-It can't be on fire!

1072
00:57:35,950 --> 00:57:37,583
真着火了。着火了。
It's on fire. It's on fire.

1073
00:57:37,617 --> 00:57:38,950
（爆炸声）
(EXPLOSION)

1074
00:57:39,917 --> 00:57:41,083
快跑啊。
Just run.

1075
00:57:42,417 --> 00:57:43,717
赶紧跑。
Just run.

1076
00:57:49,250 --> 00:57:50,350
哎呀！
Oops!

1077
00:57:53,650 --> 00:57:55,083
关键是……
The thing is...

1078
00:57:56,417 --> 00:57:57,683
（大笑）
(LAUGHING)

1079
00:58:00,817 --> 00:58:02,850
关键是，我们居然成功把一个
The thing is, we managed
to set fire to something

1080
00:58:02,883 --> 00:58:04,550
基本上全是水造的玩意儿
给点着了！
that's basically
made of water!

1081
00:58:04,583 --> 00:58:05,883
你怎么搞成那样的？
How did you do that?

1082
00:58:05,917 --> 00:58:08,917
事后你见着
洗车店老板了吗？
Did you see the owner
of the carwash afterwards?

1083
00:58:08,950 --> 00:58:10,883
他快气炸了，火大得很。
He was cross. Very cross.

1084
00:58:10,917 --> 00:58:14,350
尤其是我后来给他打电话，
管他要回咱们那3镑50便士的时候。
He was especially cross
when I rang him up and
asked him for our £3.50 back.

1085
00:58:14,383 --> 00:58:16,083
（观众大笑）
(CROWD LAUGHING)

1086
00:58:16,117 --> 00:58:20,017
-真是不妙。
-我们在节目开头曾问过，
造一辆敞篷
-Not good.
-We asked earlier on
how hard it would be

1087
00:58:20,050 --> 00:58:22,317
多功能休旅车
究竟能有多难。
to make a convertible
people carrier.

1088
00:58:22,350 --> 00:58:24,083
-答案是：巨难。
-没错，难得要命。
-The answer is very.
-Yeah, very.

1089
00:58:24,117 --> 00:58:26,917
伴随着这份
令人心碎的失望，
本期节目也该收尾了，
And on that
crushing disappointment,
it's time to end the show,

1090
00:58:26,950 --> 00:58:29,850
我们四位在此，
感谢大家的收看。
so from the four of us,
thanks for watching.

1091
00:58:29,883 --> 00:58:31,317
下周再见，
晚安！
See you next week,
good night!

1092
00:58:31,350 --> 00:58:36,350
